        '843GLV9RC' => ['short' => 'Wrinkle-resistant preaching gown with cross embroidery — dignified pulpit wear for pastors, priests and choirs.', 'description' => '<p>The preaching gown — also called a pulpit or Geneva gown — is the classic dress of the preaching ministry, with a lineage that runs from the academic robes of the Reformers to Presbyterian, Methodist and Reformed pulpits across Kenya today. Worn Sunday after Sunday, it clothes the preacher in dignity so the message, not the wardrobe, holds the room.</p><p>This gown is cut from wrinkle-resistant <strong>85% polyester</strong> fabric that keeps its drape through long services, and is finished with a traditional <strong>cross-print embroidery</strong>. Each package includes one gown.</p><p>A worthy choice for pastors, priests, pulpit ministers and choir leaders — for weekly services, baptisms and church occasions across Kenya and East Africa, with delivery worldwide from our Nairobi shop at Sonalux House, Moi Avenue.</p>', 'features' => [['icon' => '📖', 'text' => 'Classic pulpit and Geneva-style gown for the preaching ministry'], ['icon' => '🧵', 'text' => 'Wrinkle-resistant 85% polyester holds its drape through long services'], ['icon' => '✝️', 'text' => 'Finished with traditional cross-print embroidery'], ['icon' => '⛪', 'text' => 'Suits PCEA, Methodist, Reformed, Pentecostal and independent pulpits'], ['icon' => '🌍', 'text' => 'Delivery across Kenya, East Africa and worldwide']], 'aliases' => ['preaching gown kenya', 'pulpit gown', 'geneva gown', 'pastors gown nairobi', 'pulpit robe', 'pcea minister gown', 'minister gown kenya', 'church robes kenya', 'preaching robe', 'joho'], 'seo' => ['meta_title' => 'Preaching Gown in Nairobi, Kenya', 'meta_description' => 'Dignified pulpit and preaching gowns in wrinkle-resistant fabric with cross embroidery. Order from Nairobi — delivery across Kenya and East Africa.', 'meta_keywords' => 'preaching gown kenya, pulpit gown nairobi, geneva gown kenya, pastors gow