        'COM-SCC-001' => ['short' => 'Reusable silver communion cups, 10 ml each — a dignified, lasting way to serve the Lord\'s Supper to every member.', 'description' => '<p>Small silver communion cups of 10 ml capacity — the familiar single-serve measure for the Lord\'s Supper. Made of silver material, they are durable and fully reusable: washed and kept with care, a set like this serves a congregation faithfully for years.</p><p>Individual cups are the heart of Holy Communion in Methodist, PCEA, Pentecostal and many independent churches — each member receives from their own cup, with hygiene and dignity. The silver finish brings a quiet, heirloom gravity to the communion table that disposables cannot.</p><ul><li><strong>10 ml capacity</strong> — the classic individual serving</li><li>Silver material: durable and reusable, service after service</li><li>A dignified upgrade from disposable cups for the communion table</li><li>Care: wash in warm water with mild soap and dry with a soft cloth</li></ul><p>Order for your church from Sonalux House, Moi Avenue, Nairobi — delivery across Kenya, East Africa and worldwide.</p>', 'features' => [['icon' => '🥈', 'text' => 'Silver material — durable, dignified and fully reusable, service after service'], ['icon' => '💧', 'text' => '10 ml capacity — the familiar individual serving for the Lord\'s Supper'], ['icon' => '🤝', 'text' => 'Each member receives an individual cup, with hygiene and dignity'], ['icon' => '♻️', 'text' => 'A lasting, heirloom upgrade from disposable communion cups'], ['icon' => '⛪', 'text' => 'Loved by Methodist, PCEA, Pentecostal and independent congregations'], ['icon' => '🚚', 'text' => 'Order from Nairobi CBD — delivery across Kenya, East Africa and worldwide']], 'aliases' => ['silver communion glasses', 'metal communion cups', 'individual communion cups', 'reusable communion cups', 'communion cups kenya', 'vikombe vya ushirika', '10ml communion cups', 'communion wares'], 'seo' => ['meta_title' => 'Silver 