        'CSMHIJ6R8' => ['short' => 'A golden pectoral cross worn at the centre of the chest — a dignified mark of office for bishops and honoured clergy.', 'description' => '<p>A <strong>golden</strong> pectoral cross, worn at the centre of the chest in the tradition the church has kept for centuries. Among Anglicans, Catholics and Methodists it distinguishes bishops; in Orthodox practice a priest may be awarded one in honour; and across Kenya’s Pentecostal and independent churches it crowns apostles and overseers.</p><p>The warm golden tone reads richly against dark cassocks and bright vestments alike — a dignified companion for Sunday liturgy, ordinations, weddings, funerals and every service in between.</p><ul><li>Warm golden tone that stands out over dark vestments</li><li>Worn by bishops and honoured clergy across the denominations</li><li>Suited to Sunday liturgy and high ceremonial occasions alike</li><li>A meaningful gift for an ordination or ministry milestone</li></ul><p>Chosen with reverence, delivered with care — from Sonalux House, Moi Avenue, Nairobi to churches across Kenya, East Africa and the world.</p>', 'features' => [['icon' => '✨', 'text' => 'Warm golden tone that reads richly over dark vestments'], ['icon' => '⛪', 'text' => 'Distinguishes bishops; awarded to honoured clergy in Orthodox practice'], ['icon' => '🙏', 'text' => 'Worn at the centre of the chest in the church’s long tradition'], ['icon' => '🎁', 'text' => 'A meaningful ordination or ministry-milestone gift'], ['icon' => '🌍', 'text' => 'Delivered across Kenya, East Africa and worldwide']], 'aliases' => ['golden cross', 'pectoral cross', 'bishop\'s cross', 'gold clergy cross', 'msalaba wa dhahabu', 'cross for clergy', 'pectoral cross nairobi', 'golden pectoral cross kenya'], 'seo' => ['meta_title' => 'Golden Pectoral Cross for Clergy — Kenya', 'meta_description' => 'Golden pectoral cross worn at the centre of the chest by bishops and honoured clergy. Available in Nairobi CBD, delivered across Kenya and worldwide.', 'meta_keywords' => 'golden pectoral cross, pectoral cross kenya, bishop cross nairobi, gold cross for clergy, clergy accessories nairobi, bishop regalia kenya, church supplies nairobi, msalaba', 'og_title' => 'Golden Pectoral Cross — A Dignified Mark of Office', 'og_description' => 'A golden pectoral cross for bishops and honoured clergy — worn at the centre of the chest through every season of ministry. From Bethany House, Nairobi, delivered worldwide.']],
        'CVB-0010' => ['short' => 'The bishop\'s ceremonial mitre — twin peaks recalling the Old and New Testaments, made to order in Nairobi.', 'description' => '<p>The <strong>mitre</strong> is the bishop’s ceremonial headdress, rising to two peaks — the cornua, classically read as the <strong>Old and New Testaments</strong> the bishop must teach and guard — with two lappets falling at the back. The twin points are also often said to recall the tongues of fire at Pentecost.</p><p>Worn at ordinations, confirmations, consecrations and high festivals, it crowns the episcopal vesture of Anglican, Catholic, Methodist and Orthodox bishops — and of apostles and presiding bishops across Kenya’s Pentecostal and independent churches.</p><p>Each mitre is <strong>made to order by our Nairobi tailors</strong> — measured and sewn so it sits well and matches your vesture. Order from Sonalux House, Moi Avenue, with delivery across Kenya, East Africa and worldwide.</p>', 'features' => [['icon' => '👑', 'text' => 'The bishop\'s ceremonial headdress for ordinations and high festivals'], ['icon' => '✂️', 'text' => 'Made to order by our Nairobi tailors to match your vesture'], ['icon' => '📖', 'text' => 'Twin peaks classically read as the Old and New Testaments'], ['icon' => '⛪', 'text' => 'For Anglican, Catholic, Methodist, Orthodox and Pentecostal bishops'], ['icon' => '🌍', 'text' => 'Delivery across Kenya, East Africa and worldwide']], 'aliases' => ['miter', 'bishop hat', 'bishops hat', 'bishop\'s headdress', 'mitre kenya', 'kofia ya askofu', 'bishop regalia kenya', 'mitre hat'], 'seo' => ['meta_title' => 'Bishop\'s Mitre, Made to Order — Nairobi, Kenya', 'meta_description' => 'The bishop\'s ceremonial mitre, made to order by Bethany House tailors in Nairobi. Delivered across Kenya, East Africa and worldwide.', 'meta_keywords' => 'bishop mitre kenya, mitre nairobi, bishop hat kenya, miter, bishop regalia kenya, bishop headdress, made to measure vestments nairobi, church supplies nair