        'XZIQU3RFM' => ['short' => '32 oz motivational bottle with time markers and a leak-proof flip lid — BPA-free hydration for long services and busy days.', 'description' => '<p>Ministry means long days and much speaking — the <strong>Executive Water Bottle</strong> keeps the vessel cared for while you care for the Word. Its motivational quote and time markers pace your drinking through the day, so hydration happens without thinking about it.</p><ul><li>Generous 32 oz capacity — enough for a full service, rehearsal or seminar</li><li>Time markers and motivational quote track your daily water intake</li><li>Flip-top lid with secure lock — dust-free and leak-proof in any bag</li><li>Durable, crystal-clear, BPA-free co-polyester plastic</li><li>Suitable for warm and cold beverages (-40 to 212°F)</li></ul><p>The practical companion gift: pastors preaching long services, choir practice, church staff and conference delegate packs. Bundle it with any Bible as a <strong>"care for the Word, care for the vessel"</strong> gift set.</p><p>Chosen with reverence, delivered with care — from Sonalux House, Moi Avenue, Nairobi, across Kenya, East Africa and worldwide.</p>', 'features' => [['icon' => '💧', 'text' => '32 oz capacity with time markers that pace your day\'s hydration'], ['icon' => '🔒', 'text' => 'Flip-top lid locks secure — leak-proof and dust-free in any bag'], ['icon' => '🧪', 'text' => 'Durable, crystal-clear, BPA-free co-polyester plastic'], ['icon' => '🌡️', 'text' => 'Handles warm and cold beverages (-40 to 212°F)'], ['icon' => '🎁', 'text' => 'The companion gift for pastors, choirs, staff and conference delegate packs']], 'aliases' => ['motivational water bottle', 'time marker water bottle', '32 oz water bottle', 'gift water bottle kenya', 'hydration bottle nairobi', 'bpa free water bottle', 'water bottle with times', 'conference gift kenya'], 'seo' => ['meta_title' => 'Executive Motivational Water Bottle — 32 oz, Kenya', 'meta_description' => '32 oz BPA-free mo